+
+### [EfficientGS](18681-efficientgs.md)
+EfficientGS is an optimized adaptation of 3D Gaussian Splatting (3DGS) designed for efficient large-scale, high-resolution scene representation. It reduces redundancy in 3DGS to alleviate computational and storage demands without sacrificing quality. Unlike vanilla 3DGS, which suffers from redundancy and low FPS/high storage in large-scale high-resolution scenes, EfficientGS allows for more efficient scene representation with fewer Gaussians.
 
 ### [Variational 3D Gaussians](18706-variational-3d-gaussians.md)
