 ### [EOGS (Earth-observation Gaussian Splatting)](19449-eogs-earth-observation-gaussian-splatting.md)
-Adapts 3DGS for satellite photogrammetry with shadow modeling and camera-specific corrections, replacing RPC pipelines with affine approximations [19449-eogs-earth-observation-gaussian-splatting.md].
