 ### [Connectivity-based Visibility for 3D Gaussian Splatting](20071-connectivity-based-visibility-for-3d-gaussian-splatting.md)
-Replaces depth-ordered blending with visibility filtering based on a connectivity graph to reduce memory and accelerate large-scale rendering [20071-connectivity-based-visibility-for-3d-gaussian-splatting.md].
