 ### [GS-Scale Host Offloading](20685-gs-scale-host-offloading.md)
-Stores all Gaussian parameters and optimizer states in host (CPU) memory, transferring only necessary subsets to GPU on demand [20685-gs-scale-host-offloading.md].
