 ### [ClunoGS Unified Optimization](21178-clunogs-unified-optimization.md)
-Jointly optimizes Gaussian parameters, sparsity, and vector quantization using an augmented Lagrangian formulation to reduce storage and cost [21178-clunogs-unified-optimization.md].
