 ### [Radiance Field-Informed Gaussian Splatting](21331-radiance-field-informed-gaussian-splatting.md)
-Uses a trained NeRF to initialize and supervise 3DGS, improving robustness to lighting variations and arbitrary camera lens types [21331-radiance-field-informed-gaussian-splatting.md].
