 ### [Hybrid Gaussian Splatting](21999-hybrid-gaussian-splatting.md)
-Decouples scene into static multi-view consistent 3D Gaussians and transient single-view independent 2D Gaussians [21999-hybrid-gaussian-splatting.md].
